{"1770280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Without Judgement", "steam_appid": 1770280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without Judgement is a neo-noir open world rpg. You play as a homicide detective in near-future Florida. Explore Miami and other huge cities across Florida while solving dark, violent crimes. Experience engaging, dynamic cases and random encounters which can be solved in multiple ways. But remember, the choices you make have severe consequences... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/45d8b6e7360c97f3f33e55d0511e2bb3.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/45d8b6e7360c97f3f33e55d0511e2bb3.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=588 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES MATTER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will shape the story and its outcome. Multiple pathways to solving crimes mean you’re in control, but remember—the consequences can be devastating. Choose carefully, as each action you take ripples across the game world, altering relationships, missions, and Florida itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/fc2a0c17092e0223627a75ca8c6f6535.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/fc2a0c17092e0223627a75ca8c6f6535.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=588 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW TYPE OF RPG</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world that blends traditional RPG elements with dynamic, unconventional and cinematic storytelling and structure. Solve crimes using your own approach—whether it’s through persuasion, force, or advanced tech. Without Judgement offers players freedom in how they investigate, interact, and pursue justice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/7d93f08860833d62ba577293a7ddf505.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/7d93f08860833d62ba577293a7ddf505.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=556 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARK CINEMATIC STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sex, drugs, and violence—this is not just a murder mystery. Prepare for a dark, mature narrative that pulls you deep into the underbelly of society. Encounter morally complex characters, suicidal protagonists, brutal violence, and a city teetering on the edge of collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/aba312a6886c071fabb382daceb2588e.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/aba312a6886c071fabb382daceb2588e.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=556 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VAST OPEN WORLD</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The state of Florida is fully explorable. Discover a sprawling, richly detailed version of the state—from the neon-lit streets of Tampa to the decaying, crime-infested Florida Keys. Every district of every city is alive with opportunities, side quests, and unsolved mysteries. The world of Without Judgement is constantly evolving—random encounters and dynamic events ensure that no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/0582011f23a0ec3ceb3033e5b983a08b.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/0582011f23a0ec3ceb3033e5b983a08b.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=588 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without Judgement is a neo-noir open world rpg. You play as a homicide detective in near-future Florida. Explore Miami and other huge cities across Florida while solving dark, violent crimes. Experience engaging, dynamic cases and random encounters which can be solved in multiple ways. But remember, the choices you make have severe consequences... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/45d8b6e7360c97f3f33e55d0511e2bb3.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/45d8b6e7360c97f3f33e55d0511e2bb3.avif?t=1770657435 width=800 height=588 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES MATTER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will shape the story and its outcome. Multiple pathways to solving crimes mean you’re in control, but remember—the consequences can be devastating. Choose carefully, as each action you take ripples across the game world, altering relationships, missions, and Florida itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras/fc2a0c17092e0223627a75ca8c6f6535.avif?t=1770657435\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770280/extras_big/fc2a0c17092e0223627a75ca8c6f6535.